'''TzHaar-Ket-Keh''' is a [[TzHaar]] guarding the entrance to the [[Inferno]] minigame. He will require a sacrifice of one [[fire cape]] to allow the player to enter the Inferno challenge.

Players may exchange their [[infernal cape]]s with TzHaar-Ket-Keh for a 1/100 chance of obtaining a pet [[Jal-Nib-Rek]].

Players may use a [[Tzkal slayer helmet (i)]] on him to gain the slayer helm's accuracy and damage bonus in the Inferno and Fight Caves while the helm is equipped, without needing to be on a [[TzKal-Zuk]] or [[TzTok-Jad]] Slayer task. No Slayer XP will be gained from Inferno or Fight Caves enemies killed this way, and the boosted pet chance will not apply.

